        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Foster, Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic\n- Places: Aberdeen, Washington, Tacoma\n- Roles: bassist, musician, artist, singer, songwriter, guitarist, poet\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Cobain was born on February 20, 1967.\n- Kurt Cobain was an American musician, artist, singer, songwriter, guitarist, and poet.\n- Dave Foster lived hours away from Kurt Cobain and bassist Krist Novoselic in Aberdeen, Washington.\n- Kurt Cobain and Krist Novoselic had to pick Dave Foster up and bring him to the band's rehearsal space in Tacoma.\n- Kurt Cobain died on April 5, 1994.",
